WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.640
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:05.710
Check it!

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.790
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:30.050
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.920
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.590
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:41.490
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:46.660
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:50.370
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:53.710
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:56.210
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.510
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:00.550
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:03.080
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.880
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:07.520
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:11.620
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:15.130
Everybody, loosey

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:18.630
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:22.030
Vividly, crazy

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:25.330
Fly up, angel

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.210
Come out!

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.190
Come out, you damn ghost!

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:13.040
Dammit! How did things
wind up like this?!

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:43.080
What did this guy do?

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:46.380
Kidnap-murders. Even with children.

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:49.020
That's sick!

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.990
I'll leave you to handle
this one as usual.

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:58.920
Take care of this before I get back.
Have Amy take a look at it.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:04.890
Huh? Jo and Meg left?

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:07.330
Jo wants you to fix this...

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:14.970
So totally dirty!

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:18.000
Looks like there's
loads of places to hide.

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:26.420
This place is pretty big...

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:29.540
We'll find him faster
if we split up.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.590
Watch yourself.

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:34.920
Right...

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.480
What was that?!

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.420
Who's there?!

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:07.480
What're you doing?! Let go!

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:12.680
I won't do anything!
Please don't aim at me! It's dangerous!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:17.830
I'm innocent!

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:24.230
But if you get any closer,
I'll give this girl surgery!

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:28.240
Unfortunately, my partner's health
is her saving grace.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:30.910
You're the one who needs surgery!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:37.350
No, no. I'm healthy, too.
So let's make a deal!

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:43.120
You're my friend! If you let me go,
I'll give you money!

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:49.390
You'll profit and I'll profit!
Good business for both!

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:54.660
It's bastards like you
who piss me off the most!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:58.200
That's okay! You can't shoot!

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:03.270
If you do, I'll put a red necktie
around this girl's throat!

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:05.470
Jo! This is bad!

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:09.430
A red necktie around my throat
is totally bad news!

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:27.360
Ouch! Ouch! You're mean!

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:30.630
I want a lawyer! I have my rights--

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:37.040
I'll get you the Judges of Hell
before I get you a lawyer!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:39.340
--Contact Sei!
--Right...!

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:41.070
You loser...!

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:49.020
Oh, no! You're going to
regret doing this to me!

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:52.790
--My government will make you pay!
--Moron!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:54.360
Let me go!

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:57.190
--What's wrong?
--It's happening again...!

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.630
Dammit...!

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:21.070
Jo...?

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:27.950
Is it fixed?

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:33.860
I thought new parts might fix it,
but the inside was all melted.

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.660
--This is the cause!
--What is that?

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:41.560
I'm not really sure myself.

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:45.400
Jo! Phone for you. It's Jinno-<i>san</i>.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:47.900
The old guy?

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:54.370
Sorry for asking you along...

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.910
What are we doing here?

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:07.760
Wherever there's a cybot,
there's always action data.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:13.700
I collect this stuff from all over.
It's pretty handy to have...

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:17.430
Is this just a hobby?
Or are you a data thief?

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:21.600
These are collectors' items
meant for both hobby and profit.

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:23.770
So you're a thief.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.310
Don't talk so scandalously.

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:30.810
One a day! Real professionals
work their butts off to get data...

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:32.970
30 minutes left.

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:37.990
--What's wrong?!
--Nothing... It's my head...

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:41.420
Hurry up! I sense something bad!

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:49.060
--What was that?!
--An enemy, obviously!

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:58.100
Step on it!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.750
This is Leo! We have a situation!

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.950
We're under attack by an unknown enemy!

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.940
Jo's with me. Send Django--

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:19.850
--Hard turn right!
--I'm not a racecar driver!

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.630
Old man...!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.230
--Stay still, old man!
--Yeah...

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:45.380
Are these my--

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:52.080
No! Was someone watching me? Who?!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.340
Damn you...!

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.110
Found you!

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:45.370
Quit hangin' around and get down here.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:48.710
Or can you not get down by yourself?

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:51.700
In that case, I'll help you!

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:08.660
Crap!

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:34.590
Dammit, I get no luck...

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:01.040
Show your face already...

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:17.730
Stop!

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:19.790
What...?!

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:42.250
Why did you try to kill me?!
What is your goal?!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.520
Guess you're just an ordinary enemy!

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:55.300
<i>He's incredibly strong!</i>

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:58.400
<i>He's strong, but different
than that other guy!</i>

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.770
What's the matter?!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:13.550
Lost your motivation?

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.630
I don't want to fight you, either.

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:20.220
It looks like you made a mistake...

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:28.360
Have you seen the guy
I was chasing around here?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:39.580
My hands are still numb.
That's one heck of a sword.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:45.020
No, you're one heck of a sword expert.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.390
Of all the times...

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.690
Yeah. Lame, huh?

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:32.300
You're not gonna eat?

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.800
What an old village. You alone here?

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.310
Been here a long time?

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.610
You don't talk, do ya?

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.990
Is this your village?

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:59.760
Then why are you here?
What happened to everyone else?

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:07.960
That was good fish.
Is there any drinking water?

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:36.000
He doesn't talk, but it seems
a lot's happened to him...

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:43.200
"Destroy the steel demon."

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:07.550
You were hired to kill the monster?

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.950
You couldn't beat it?

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:22.250
You and your comrades fought
your hardest to protect this village...

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:25.870
But you couldn't...

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:30.200
So you remain here to get revenge?!

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:37.170
Is that thing still in these mountains?!

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:12.240
Finally come out into the light, huh?!

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:15.210
Wait!

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:26.290
You can't beat that with a sword!

00:21:56.350 --> 00:22:04.030
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:11.670
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:19.380
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:19.380 --> 00:22:28.750
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:35.290
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:44.300
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:51.210
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:15.830
<i>The roar of the steel demon
echoes through the battlefield.</i>

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:19.840
<i>The appearance of a new adversary
awakens Jo's memory.</i>

00:23:19.840 --> 00:23:25.170
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"A Clash! The Two Angels"
